<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>WISDOM 12</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #003366;
      --secondary: #006699;
      --accent: #ffcc00;
      --light: #f9f9f9;
      --dark: #222;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--light);
      color: var(--dark);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
      color: #fff;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      background: var(--secondary);
      padding: 10px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      margin: 0 15px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    #videos .video-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .video iframe {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    footer {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }

    footer p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>WISDOM 12</h1>
    <p>Hekima • Maarifa • Elimu • Motisha</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#videos">Videos</a>
    <a href="#articles">Articles</a>
    <a href="#community">Community</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="home">
    <h2>Karibu WISDOM 12</h2>
    <p>Hii ni tovuti rasmi ya channel ya YouTube inayoshiriki hekima, maarifa, elimu na motisha kwa watu wa rika zote.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="videos">
    <h2>Video Zetu</h2>
    <div class="video-grid">
      <div class="video">
        <h3>INJILI YA YESU KRISTO SURA YA 14</h3>
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID1" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="video">
        <h3>INJILI YA YESU KRISTO SURA YA 13</h3>
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID2" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="articles">
    <h2>Makala</h2>
    <p>Hapa utapata tafsiri za Biblia, Injili ya Thomas, na makala za motisha.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="community">
    <h2>Community</h2>
    <p>Ungana na washiriki kujadili na kushirikiana kupitia maoni na mijadala.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Mawasiliano</h2>
    <p>Email: wisdom12@example.com</p>
    <p>YouTube: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@wisdom12" target="_blank">@wisdom12</a></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 WISDOM 12. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
